infinite_scroll_pagination 4.1.0
https://github.com/EdsonBueno/infinite_scroll_pagination
https://pub.dev/packages/infinite_scroll_pagination
================================================================================

What was adapted: the public API shape. That is the names PagingController,
PagingState, PagingStatus, PagedChildBuilderDelegate and PagedListView; their
constructor, method and builder names (firstPageKey, invisibleItemsThreshold,
itemList, error, nextPageKey, appendPage, appendLastPage, refresh,
retryLastFailedRequest, addPageRequestListener, addStatusListener,
*IndicatorBuilder); and the rules that derive a PagingStatus from a
PagingState. paging_kit's code was written from scratch for DartNative. No
source file was copied.

